      "side": 1,
      "message": "-imsvc only suppresses warnings for headers resolved via angle-bracket includes (#include \u003c...\u003e). Here we use a quoted include with the full relative path so that __has_include can reliably detect the Agility SDK header regardless of include-path ordering. The compiler does not treat quoted-path includes as system headers, so the #pragma is still necessary.\n\nCould you please suggest if there is a more recommended or cleaner way to handle this case?",
